WEBVTT

00:00:01.258 --> 00:00:03.219
The space vessel Catia Ship--

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:05.888
Having traveled many light years,
it is now a solitary spaceship,

00:00:05.971 --> 00:00:07.556
wandering through the universe.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:08.807
Due to unforeseen circumstances,

00:00:08.891 --> 00:00:11.519
the crew are all in the state they are in.

00:00:11.602 --> 00:00:15.397
The acting captain is Melwin,
who just happened to survive.

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:18.609
Her partner is Luros, who has
been turned into a hologram,

00:00:18.692 --> 00:00:21.403
and the Catian crew, who evolved from cats.

00:00:21.487 --> 00:00:24.990
Where exactly are we going next?

00:00:32.706 --> 00:00:34.458
Mitaiken na no

00:00:34.542 --> 00:00:40.256
Me no mae ni kotae wa iroiro aru kedo

00:00:40.339 --> 00:00:47.471
Hitotsu no oozora wo nan toubun dekiru?

00:00:47.555 --> 00:00:49.348
Tanoshii kara subete wo kudasai

00:00:49.431 --> 00:00:51.100
atashi tteba dokusen shitai

00:00:51.183 --> 00:00:54.562
Honne ga koboreru yo Blue sky

00:00:54.645 --> 00:01:02.278
Mou! Namae wo kaite okou kienai you ni

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:04.071
Shinken ni nattara?

00:01:04.154 --> 00:01:09.285
Sou you no yada nante iwasenai

00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:16.041
Jun'ai souchi (Set up now) ugokidase

00:01:16.125 --> 00:01:20.129
Aseri to yume no kassouro

00:01:20.212 --> 00:01:24.008
Shiitoberuto wa motto gyutto itashite

00:01:24.091 --> 00:01:30.889
Saishinsouchi (Back up now) ugokidasu

00:01:30.973 --> 00:01:34.935
Anata no kokoro dake wa

00:01:35.019 --> 00:01:38.647
orijinaru ga hoshikute

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:42.651
sakusen tatemashita yo

00:01:46.989 --> 00:01:50.784
"Cat Planet Cuties"

00:02:13.182 --> 00:02:13.641
"Catian Ambassy"

00:02:13.641 --> 00:02:15.017
"Catian Ambassy" Oh... They
really made a mess of things, huh?

00:02:15.017 --> 00:02:18.437
Oh... They really made a
mess of things, huh?

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:21.357
Uncle Yuichi, and Miss Itokazu...

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:23.984
What's going on here, Kakazu?

00:02:32.284 --> 00:02:37.289
Let's go buy him a new one.
A romantic movie this time.

00:02:37.373 --> 00:02:40.834
Something that will provoke kissing
while you're watching it together.

00:02:40.918 --> 00:02:42.127
That's all right.

00:02:42.211 --> 00:02:45.881
Christmas presents aren't
really my thing to begin with.

00:02:45.964 --> 00:02:47.758
Aoi...

00:02:47.841 --> 00:02:49.802
They're not really my thing.

00:02:54.264 --> 00:02:58.310
If that big spaceship crashes,
what will happen to the Earth?

00:02:58.394 --> 00:03:00.521
It depends on its velocity at impact,

00:03:00.604 --> 00:03:04.400
but I believe it will probably
wipe out all life on Earth.

00:03:05.359 --> 00:03:09.571
But you need not worry.
Before the spaceship can hit the Earth,

00:03:09.655 --> 00:03:12.616
it is programmed to self-destruct.

00:03:12.700 --> 00:03:13.992
Self-destruct?

00:03:14.076 --> 00:03:17.621
Large-scale spaceships are built
such that if they approach a planet

00:03:17.705 --> 00:03:20.332
without reducing velocity,

00:03:20.416 --> 00:03:23.711
the crystalline structure of
the hull fragments explosively,

00:03:23.794 --> 00:03:26.547
and gasifies, so as to
avoid any impact damage.

00:03:26.630 --> 00:03:28.632
Then what about the crew?

00:03:28.716 --> 00:03:32.094
Normally, they would
get out in escape pods,

00:03:32.177 --> 00:03:36.807
but since time is now frozen
for them, they are unable to escape.

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:39.893
The bridge is isolated
in a separate dimension,

00:03:39.977 --> 00:03:42.104
so there is no worry of an attack on us.

00:03:42.187 --> 00:03:44.982
Can't you change the spaceship's trajectory?

00:03:46.275 --> 00:03:47.067
To do that...

00:03:47.109 --> 00:03:50.279
To do that, we would need the
captain's top-level command codes

00:03:50.362 --> 00:03:54.992
to bring the main systems down
temporarily, and then restart them.

00:03:55.075 --> 00:03:57.494
That's not something
the executive officer can do?

00:03:57.578 --> 00:04:01.457
The top-level command
codes are a part of her being.

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.417
Someone who has the rank
of captain is first identified

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:07.421
at the genetic level before
their commands are executed.

00:04:07.504 --> 00:04:10.382
Even if I am in charge of the ship,

00:04:10.466 --> 00:04:14.595
as long as Captain Qoone is alive,
| cannot take over for her.

00:04:14.678 --> 00:04:17.681
So that's why they went to
the trouble of knocking her out,

00:04:17.765 --> 00:04:19.475
rather than killing her.

00:04:19.558 --> 00:04:22.603
Which means that somehow,
we have to be the ones

00:04:22.686 --> 00:04:24.897
to go rescue the other crewmembers.

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:31.069
If we can just get into space,
it's not out of the question.

00:04:31.153 --> 00:04:33.071
But now that Luros has been destroyed,

00:04:33.155 --> 00:04:35.532
there is no way for us to get into space.

00:04:35.616 --> 00:04:39.119
Nor is there a way to take the captain there.

00:04:39.203 --> 00:04:41.622
And even if we could,
she couldn't order the restart

00:04:41.705 --> 00:04:45.959
if she's unconscious. It's all over now.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.880
Captain Qoone's bell...

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:01.475
W-What?

00:05:01.558 --> 00:05:05.020
C-Come to think of it, Kio,
when the captain collapsed,

00:05:05.103 --> 00:05:06.814
you were holding her bell, right?

00:05:06.897 --> 00:05:08.357
U-Uh-huh.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:10.567
Did she turn it over to you?

00:05:10.651 --> 00:05:13.904
Mm-hmm. I don't get it,
but she said to please take it.

00:05:16.615 --> 00:05:20.452
Today, as of this moment,
we, the crew of the Catia Ship,

00:05:20.536 --> 00:05:23.956
are now under your command...

00:05:24.039 --> 00:05:25.833
Captain Kakazu Kio!

00:05:25.916 --> 00:05:28.168
M-Me, the captain?!

00:05:36.134 --> 00:05:37.386
| see.

00:05:37.469 --> 00:05:41.807
| understand the situation.
| will see what I can do.

00:05:41.890 --> 00:05:46.019
If you wish it, Miss Eris,
| will see to it that it comes true.

00:05:46.103 --> 00:05:47.771
I will speak with you later.

00:05:47.855 --> 00:05:50.232
Maya, we have some shopping to do!

00:05:50.315 --> 00:05:52.818
What might that be, my lady?

00:05:52.901 --> 00:05:56.154
| want a rocket, and I want it right away.

00:05:56.238 --> 00:05:58.031
As you wish.

00:05:59.616 --> 00:06:02.911
Antonia says that she will buy us a rocket.

00:06:02.995 --> 00:06:04.079
