Otherwise, think of poor Aoi.

00:15:02.367 --> 00:15:05.453
It sure is big, huh?

00:15:05.537 --> 00:15:07.956
Think about it, she tells me...

00:15:12.001 --> 00:15:13.670
Is this where you are?

00:15:14.546 --> 00:15:15.755
What are you thinking?

00:15:15.839 --> 00:15:17.715
Huh? W-What do you mean?

00:15:17.799 --> 00:15:20.176
Why would you ask
Kio something like that?

00:15:21.094 --> 00:15:22.554
What are you thinking?

00:15:22.637 --> 00:15:26.808
Oh, well, he can be so dim, you know?

00:15:26.891 --> 00:15:29.686
At the rate things are going,
Christmas will be ruined.

00:15:29.769 --> 00:15:32.814
If we don't do something,
he'll never come around to you, Aoi.

00:15:32.897 --> 00:15:37.068
Nobody asked you! Do you realize
the situation we're in right now?

00:15:37.152 --> 00:15:38.611
Y-Yeah, I know...

00:15:38.695 --> 00:15:42.824
No, you don't! This is the first
time we'll be going into space!

00:15:42.907 --> 00:15:44.909
There's no telling what might happen!

00:15:45.869 --> 00:15:48.413
And yet, you bring that up.

00:15:48.496 --> 00:15:50.957
If Kio's emotions get all mixed up,

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:52.834
clouding his judgment and actions,

00:15:52.917 --> 00:15:55.587
and he gets hurt,
then what are you going to do?

00:15:56.838 --> 00:15:59.048
Think things through a little more!

00:15:59.132 --> 00:16:01.885
What about you, Aoi?

00:16:03.178 --> 00:16:06.014
Here in a situation where we
don't know what might happen,

00:16:06.097 --> 00:16:08.057
if worse comes to worst, Aoi,

00:16:08.141 --> 00:16:11.644
are you sure you can live
without getting an answer from Kio?

00:16:11.728 --> 00:16:13.563
And if the operation is a success,

00:16:13.646 --> 00:16:17.650
Eris and Kio just might
become even closer to each other.

00:16:17.734 --> 00:16:20.403
You think that what I did was meddling.

00:16:20.487 --> 00:16:22.947
But wouldn't you feel frustrated, Aoi?!

00:16:23.031 --> 00:16:27.076
Having it all end without him
realizing what your feelings were?

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:29.204
You're still meddling.

00:16:30.497 --> 00:16:34.167
When you're in love with Kio, too, Manami.

00:16:35.877 --> 00:16:38.379
You think I didn't know?

00:16:39.631 --> 00:16:43.092
What about you? Are you okay
with Kio not knowing how you feel?

00:16:43.176 --> 00:16:45.094
With not getting an answer from him?

00:16:45.178 --> 00:16:49.140
Won't you be frustrated,
having it end before it even began?

00:16:51.726 --> 00:16:54.854
You can't express your
feelings to him either, can you?

00:16:54.938 --> 00:16:57.774
This is no time to be
worrying about me, right?

00:16:57.857 --> 00:17:01.152
Making others do something
that you're unable to do yourself...

00:17:01.236 --> 00:17:03.404
...is nothing but being a nosy meddler!

00:17:11.329 --> 00:17:14.165
"Calm down!" "Don't fight"

00:17:18.419 --> 00:17:21.714
Intruders! All units, alert status!

00:17:21.798 --> 00:17:22.799
Spies?!

00:17:22.882 --> 00:17:24.842
That's impossible!

00:17:24.926 --> 00:17:26.719
I'll search this way.

00:17:26.803 --> 00:17:28.179
Roger!

00:17:38.189 --> 00:17:39.107
Kio!

00:17:39.190 --> 00:17:40.233
Futaba!

00:17:40.316 --> 00:17:43.319
Don't move. I've placed
bombs throughout the base.

00:17:43.403 --> 00:17:45.196
You're that guy...

00:17:49.117 --> 00:17:51.411
You... survived?

00:17:51.494 --> 00:17:54.831
You're the one. That grimy assassin.

00:17:54.914 --> 00:17:56.708
| wouldn't throw stones if I were you.

00:17:56.791 --> 00:17:58.376
Don't move!

00:17:59.043 --> 00:18:04.841
I'm not like you. You don't fight
for country. You're just a killer.

00:18:04.924 --> 00:18:05.967
| do have a country.

00:18:06.050 --> 00:18:09.345
Don't make me laugh.
Do you love your country?

00:18:10.638 --> 00:18:12.682
You protect a country you do not love,

00:18:12.765 --> 00:18:15.393
and serve a planet
that you do not know.

00:18:15.476 --> 00:18:18.896
You're nothing but
a mercenary-- a killer.

00:18:20.106 --> 00:18:21.941
Futaba...

00:18:22.025 --> 00:18:23.693
Put down your gun.

00:18:23.776 --> 00:18:30.575
Whoa, I know about your power.
Any false moves, and I shoot him.

00:18:30.658 --> 00:18:31.367
--Now!

00:18:31.367 --> 00:18:32.744
--Futaba...
--Now!

00:18:47.008 --> 00:18:49.218
You can thank Catia!

00:18:49.302 --> 00:18:51.888
They believe that death is
the abandonment of potential,

00:18:51.971 --> 00:18:54.682
so they won't have it.

00:18:54.766 --> 00:18:56.392
Aoi!

00:18:56.476 --> 00:18:58.061
Restrain that man!

00:19:00.688 --> 00:19:02.690
Are you all right, Kio?

00:19:02.774 --> 00:19:04.150
U-Uh-huh.

00:19:04.233 --> 00:19:07.320
Thanks, Futaba. You saved me.

00:19:12.075 --> 00:19:16.704
I'm sorry. I had no idea there was
an enemy mixed in with my ranks.

00:19:16.788 --> 00:19:20.083
You're the enemy here, you traitor!

00:19:21.334 --> 00:19:23.419
This facility is the
property of the motherland.

00:19:23.503 --> 00:19:27.048
Selling it off on your own makes you a traitor!

00:19:27.131 --> 00:19:28.883
Miss Eris, we've got a problem!

00:19:28.966 --> 00:19:31.636
NATO forces will be here before long!

00:19:32.762 --> 00:19:35.264
Two NATO tank battalions
that were out on maneuvers

00:19:35.348 --> 00:19:38.893
have steered in this direction,
and are on the move.

00:19:38.976 --> 00:19:41.270
According to my intelligence,
they're executing a program

00:19:41.354 --> 00:19:43.356
involving the destruction of a missile base

00:19:43.439 --> 00:19:45.525
that has been taken over by terrorists.

00:19:46.818 --> 00:19:49.821
This should be good.
We're the target, are we?

00:19:49.904 --> 00:19:52.365
There are roughly three hours before they arrive.

00:19:52.448 --> 00:19:54.742
We have to complete it in under three hours.

00:19:54.826 --> 00:19:59.622
Three hours won't be enough.
We also need time to fuel it.

00:19:59.706 --> 00:20:00.623
Kio...

00:20:00.707 --> 00:20:02.083
Mm-hmm!

00:21:02.977 --> 00:21:04.353
| did it!

00:21:05.062 --> 00:21:06.189
Kio!

00:21:06.272 --> 00:21:09.734
Wow, amazing! I really did it.

00:21:09.817 --> 00:21:12.236
Nicely done, Kio.

00:21:12.320 --> 00:21:14.697
The design is a little
old-fashioned, though.

00:21:14.781 --> 00:21:17.742
| bet Miss ltokazu
would be thrilled to see it.

00:21:21.871 --> 00:21:24.707
Hurry! We're out of time!

00:21:24.791 --> 00:21:28.044
Everyone get ready to take off.
Leave this to us.

00:21:28.127 --> 00:21:29.587
We'll take care of them.

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:34.425
| won't let anyone come
between our kitty-eared friendship.

00:21:34.509 --> 00:21:36.969
Right. Thank you very much.

00:21:37.053 --> 00:21:38.638
Come, quickly, everyone!

00:21:38.721 --> 00:21:39.639
Right!

00:21:39.722 --> 00:21:42.141
Matrey, time to strike.

00:21:43.684 --> 00:21:45.978
And now, overwhelmed with emotions,

00:21:46.062 --> 00:21:48.898
the youngsters board the rocket.

00:21:48.981 --> 00:21:52.443
Feelings shared, and feelings unrequited...

00:21:52.527 --> 00:21:57.281
As each of them bears their own confusion,
they head off to battle.

00:21:57.365 --> 00:22:00.034
But what will the outcome be?

00:22:08.668 --> 00:22:11.128
Whisked off to a world of dreams,

00:22:11.212 --> 00:22:14.131
don't hesitate, let's take off!

00:22:14.215 --> 00:22:19.595
I'm going to drop by

00:22:19.679 --> 00:22:22.265
to hang out with you

00:22:32.024 --> 00:22:37.280
All this excitement
can be found sitting in the sun

00:22:37.363 --> 00:22:42.410
Happy Sunshine,
something good is bound to happen

00:22:42.493 --> 00:22:48.040
Let's stick our happiness
into a bouncy rhythm

00:22:48.124 --> 00:22:54.380
and ride the lucky waves through summer

00:22:55.590 --> 00:22:58.092
Don't limit how far we can go

00:22:58.175 --> 00:23:01.053
| want to know how far it is

00:23:01.137 --> 00:23:05.975
Fluttering, touching, my heart is an airship

00:23:06.058 --> 00:23:08.561
Gather in the fun things

00:23:08.644 --> 00:23:11.522
and let them bloom ever brighter

00:23:11.606 --> 00:23:17.028
My heart leaps at the sound

00:23:17.111 --> 00:23:20.072
of your voice

00:23:34.420 --> 00:23:37.632
The sea of space is my sea,
and my sea is also my sea!

00:23:37.715 --> 00:23:39.300
That which stands against the reign of power

00:23:39.383 --> 00:23:41.886
is the force of cat
and eyeglasses justice!

00:23:41.969 --> 00:23:44.597
Next time, "I Came to Find You."

00:23:44.680 --> 00:23:47.350
I'm coming to drop in on you!

00:23:52.396 --> 00:23:53.439
"See you next time!"
